(i)
the constitution and determination of the functions of the Boards of Studies;
(j)
the discipline, health and welfare of students of the University;
(k)
the constitution, powers and duties of University Extension Boards; and
(l)
all matters which by this Act or by the Statutes may be provided for by the Ordinances.
